<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>波动性如何破坏套利交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/how-volatility-is-undermining-the-carry-trade-video</link><description>投资者借入日元、欧元和美元等货币的套利交易在今年早些时候带来强劲回报后变得越来越难操作。彭博社的加菲猫雷诺兹讨论了市场变化如何影响该策略的吸引力。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/how-volatility-is-undermining-the-carry-trade-video'&gt;波动性如何破坏套利交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How Volatility is Undermining the Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/how-volatility-is-undermining-the-carry-trade-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:40:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Rise With Nasdaq Futures, Treasuries Fall: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Mahanadi Coalfields 首次公开募股 9.69 亿美元后将在孟买首次亮相</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mahanadi-coalfields-set-for-mumbai-debut-after-969-million-ipo</link><description>国有煤炭印度有限公司旗下的 Mahanadi Coalfields Ltd. 将于周五在首次公开募股后开始交易，这是自印度市场监管机构禁止公布 IPO 股票所谓的灰市价格以来的首次上市。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mahanadi-coalfields-set-for-mumbai-debut-after-969-million-ipo'&gt;Mahanadi Coalfields 首次公开募股 9.69 亿美元后将在孟买首次亮相&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mahanadi Coalfields Set for Mumbai Debut After $969 Million IPO&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mahanadi-coalfields-set-for-mumbai-debut-after-969-million-ipo</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</link><description>日本烟草公司股价上涨，此前有消息称该卷烟制造商正在探索与奥驰亚集团公司收购帝国品牌公司的可能性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover'&gt;日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan Tobacco Climbs on Potential Imperial Brands Takeover&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:26:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>国际货币基金组织认为澳大利亚 3.1 万亿美元养老金面临新风险</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-sees-emerging-risks-in-australia-s-3-1-trillion-of-pensions</link><description>国际货币基金组织指出了澳大利亚快速增长的养老金体系中出现的一系列新风险，包括随着一波工人进入退休年龄而保持更多资产流动性的挑战。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-sees-emerging-risks-in-australia-s-3-1-trillion-of-pensions'&gt;国际货币基金组织认为澳大利亚 3.1 万亿美元养老金面临新风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：IMF Sees Emerging Risks in Australia’s $3.1 Trillion of Pensions&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-sees-emerging-risks-in-australia-s-3-1-trillion-of-pensions</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:15:34 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>